<title>USA: Mercury Air Q3 shr diluted $0.13 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>Mercury Air Q3 shr diluted $0.13 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine Months ended   Three months ended</p>
<p>				 March 31,		March 31,</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Sales and</p>
<p>  revenue   $215,765,000 $164,531,000 $72,457,000 $57,255,000</p>
<p> Net Income    3,861,000    3,495,000   1,134,000     877,000</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
